('建筑与空间',['What kind of buildings do you notice?','Do you like quiet places?','Is there a building you often visit?'],'Describe a building you think works well for its users.',['where it is','who uses it','which features you notice','and explain why it works well'],['Should appearance or function matter more in design?','How can designers understand different users?','Should old buildings always be preserved?'],['用入口、采光、布局等具体特征解释功能。','P3 权衡可达性、文化价值和成本。']),
('组织与活动',['Do you enjoy organising things?','How do you remember appointments?','Do you like attending group events?'],'Describe an event you helped to organise.',['what the event was','who was involved','what your role was','and explain what you would do differently next time'],['What makes an event accessible?','How can organisers deal with unexpected changes?','Should community events rely on volunteers?'],['安排→意外→处理→反思，比单纯报活动流程更完整。','P3 具体解释公平参与与资源限制。']),
('创意与制作',['Do you enjoy making things?','What creative activities did you try as a child?','Do you like giving handmade gifts?'],'Describe something you made yourself.',['what you made','why you made it','how you made it','and explain what you liked or disliked about the process'],['Can creativity be taught?','Why do people value handmade objects?','How does technology change creative work?'],['不必成品完美，过程困难也能形成展开。','P3 不把技术一概说成提高或破坏创造力。']),
('道歉与沟通',['Is it easy for you to explain a problem?','Do you prefer calls or messages for important conversations?','How do you handle misunderstandings?'],'Describe a time you resolved a misunderstanding.',['who was involved','what caused the misunderstanding','how you dealt with it','and explain what changed afterwards'],['Why do misunderstandings occur across cultures?','Is written communication always clearer?','How should organisations respond to complaints?'],['清楚交代误会来源，不需要将对方描写得很差。','P3 比较媒介与语境限制。']),
